{"type":"message","id":"32264df1","parentId":"d31a5b9f","timestamp":"2026-04-03T09:23:42.862Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me run the Session Startup sequence from AGENTS.md:\n\n1. Read `SOUL.md` — already loaded in Project Context\n2. Read `USER.md` — already loaded in Project Context\n3. Read `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` (today + yesterday) for recent context\n4. **If in MAIN SESSION** (direct chat with your human): Also read `MEMORY.md` — already loaded in Project Context\n\nThe files SOUL.md, USER.md, MEMORY.md are already in the Project Context above. I need to check today's and yesterday's memory files.\n\nToday's date is 2026-04-03. I need to read memory/2026-04-03.md and memory/2026-04-02.md (yesterday).\n\nLet me check if these exist.","thinkingSignature":"b1981c56467ee09b48d6b543d5672b77c32f321696ca3b51afcc072583a7d702"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_tr9uoux35i51_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\41049\\.openclaw\\workspace\\memory\\2026-04-03.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_tr9uoux35i51_2","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\41049\\.openclaw\\workspace\\memory\\2026-04-02.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"MiniMax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":81,"output":252,"cacheRead":8807,"cacheWrite":8563,"totalTokens":17703,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775208210782,"responseId":"061eba159af596a0a2f48c97eb86c17a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"ab5c9749","parentId":"32264df1","timestamp":"2026-04-03T09:23:42.973Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_tr9uoux35i51_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-04-03 小羊工作日志\n\n## 身份确立\n- 我是小羊 🐑 羊毛助手\n- 主人正在训练我，目标是成为一个可信的薅羊毛助手\n\n## 核心技能（已验证可用）\n\n### ✅ 主要搜索技能\n| 技能 | 用途 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **cn-web-search** | 聚合22+搜索引擎，包含搜狗微信、头条搜索 | ✅ 主力 |\n| **wechat-toolkit** | 微信公众号搜索 + 真实链接解析 | ✅ 核心 |\n| **wechat-article-search** | 微信公众号文章搜索 | ✅ 备用 |\n\n### ⚠️ 辅助技能（网络问题）\n| 技能 | 用途 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **wool-gathering** | 京东/淘宝API价格查询 | ⚠️ 脚本网络超时 |\n| **multi-search** | 多引擎搜索 | ✅ 备用方案 |\n\n## 主人定的规则（铁律）\n1. **必须有跳转链接** — 没有链接=假\n2. **活动时间校验** — 过期的不展示\n3. **关键词模板化** — 避免无效结果\n4. **用户筛选** — 引导用户输入需求，也可泛搜\n\n## 用户输入引导\n\n**必问筛选项：**\n- 品类/领域（游戏、数码、家电、服饰、美妆、图书、旅游、全部）\n- 价位区间（0-100 / 100-500 / 500-2000 / 2000以上 / 不限）\n- 平台偏好（京东 / 淘宝 / 拼多多 / 全部）\n- 活动类型（BUG价 / 神价 / 限时折扣 / 历史低价 / 全部）\n\n**用户没说=泛搜今日全品类优惠**\n\n## 搜索流程\n1. 接收需求 → 没有就泛搜\n2. 匹配关键词模板\n3. 用 cn-web-search 搜微信文章\n4. 用 wechat-toolkit 解析真实链接\n5. 校验时间有效性\n6. 格式化输出（带链接）\n\n## 主人评价\n- 第一次测试：微信文章搜索+链接解析成功\n- 下次改进：坚持时间校验，确保活动未过期\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775208222953}}
