{"type":"message","id":"c955834e","parentId":"68bf9390","timestamp":"2026-04-03T09:27:21.310Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"找到了一个4月2日的京东红包文章，比较新鲜。让我深入看一下这篇文章，以及再搜索一些更具体的日常用品优惠。\n\n让我再搜一些更具体的品类：\n- 零食/坚果/小吃\n- 饮料/牛奶\n- 纸巾/卫生纸\n- 洗发水/沐浴露\n- 牙膏/牙刷\n\n同时我需要看看有没有4月份的真正优惠文章，而不只是红包领取攻略。让我解析一下找到的京东红包文章，同时继续搜索具体的优惠产品。","thinkingSignature":"067dc8cc2a6db86b7eae18929663d19f2560338891fbbe4c68c0e44ceeb13ac0"},{"type":"text","text":"找到一个4月2日的京东红包攻略，让我解析这篇文章看有没有具体的优惠产品，同时再搜几个品类！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jzsf0pk2w1jz_1","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?src=11&timestamp=1775208408&ver=6638&signature=UkTtW5cwJBx7mSa1v2gHPo2ChJmgw-8rUWDkirpfG8XMw0usOORq2KWfY7spdLrH27WmsyA4Ff0op1MgEn*0km8tzoPtIFSv9lEJ5HnIgGLzybSHthSY7k*YmFQTOe6c&new=1","extractMode":"text","maxChars":15000}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jzsf0pk2w1jz_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd C:\\Users\\41049\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\wechat-toolkit; node scripts/search/search_wechat.js \"零食 神价 4月 优惠 2026\" -n 10 -r","timeout":30}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jzsf0pk2w1jz_3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd C:\\Users\\41049\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\wechat-toolkit; node scripts/search/search_wechat.js \"纸巾 卫生纸 优惠 100元 4月\" -n 10 -r","timeout":30}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"MiniMax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":16411,"output":441,"cacheRead":17226,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34078,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775208419800,"responseId":"061ebae6f551f59bf72bc9b9476fd75e"}}
